<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt">Gal</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">U wasika u Bulus kurwa pa Hagaletiyawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />
  </para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 1:1">Pa Bulus, una usa almajiri a Yesu, sa cicuma ci buco ko aco, ama cicuma ci Yesu Kristi na Hwinsu Buca abuci, buna bu ansinge Yesu pa aco akwajo.<verse eid="GAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ka̱mu ahun ana yiwa tare na gya, Korwa pa hacoci hana ha yiwa na Galatiya: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />I burya̱ na dala a lafiya an a sirya pa Hwinsu Buca̱ abuci na Bugwama bu doonee Yesu Kristi, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yesu ina i pan icwa eba zwama magwata̠ a maci zwama ici handgage pa aco magwata̱ mu zamani, inga Hwinsu na Buca abuci buba yaje, <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />pa Yesu ka̱mu izangacu eba yiwa tun na jigo hal ihogu. Harbuni.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza cikarigo ci laco cina ci zake cina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Na hoge mamake dinyiya nga̱ gya na hoge i yiwa na curya buna bui i oga zwama i burya̱ a Kristi na ginbo ikore cikarigo ci menwa <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />cina ci sa cikarigo ci burya̱. Na hoge aza aco na yiwa na asingagya hankali na ginbo ai tane pa rudu na ginbo a bicikagi cikarigo ci laco ci Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ama sa ciki nuci ko acuma a Hwinsu sa hin buna bui kolage cikarigo cina ci nya̠ganowa na cina ci ga̠ci ci kolageya, i tane bwa uno eewo! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Nga̱ ga̠ci ci zwama, na jidana zwamana: Sa buca̱hya̱ boi karigyane cikarigo cina ci nya̱ganuwa na cina ci ga̠ci ci ce, i tane bwa uno eewo! <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ko ihya an na ginbo aco yaje na ina gya na yiwa na zwamag, ko hinda ci Hwinsu? Ko hinda na gimbo isan aco hoge laco? Aye, sa harbuni, na za isana bugyama bu Kristi.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ogwa u Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Ahun numui, na gimbo i daki, cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci gya na zwaman ci sa i eagu i buco. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Na ciwa pa buco, ko hinda an cibage; kwa di, Yesu Kristi ibe ina cibage ni icwa eba. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />I hoge iri dala ana gya na i pa adini a hayahudawa, inga gya panga aco coci u Hwinsu wahala na i kokari ihone coci. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Hinda i daki ka̱mu na zake idakagu ya adini a hayahudawa ana gaci cisa unwanzu nab hinda na hoge laco dinya dakagi adini a hakaka a haci. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ama nga̱ Hwinsu, uba na tanga tun na maco numui hinda u hoge laco na i burya̱, na oga <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Hwinsu una cebei Bwa buba Yesu Almasihu zwama gya kolage aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu cikarigo cuba, Na kabanuwo buciyahya, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />ko hinda na korowa Urshalima zwama kabo aco na ni zwalagi silmajiri si Yesu, ama na halage kore Arabiya kwa hinda gya na maringya Damasku. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Hinda nga̱ haya hataco hab aliyi, Na aliyi korwo u Urshalima zwama cimadakagi na Bitrus gya yinsa pa bware mohon ikope na muta. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Na hyanuwo almajiri a Yesu-kwa di Yakub, buhun bu Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Kamahinda zwama Hwinsu ina gya na rubuci isa cibya. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Daga pini na kore cinge ci Suriya na Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Na lokaci uni aco hacoci na Yahudiya an ai sa Krista ai na dakuwo. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />A hoge di labari numui:&lt;&lt;Buco buna bu yanse na cipana wahala bu sanwa bane ne kimgana cikarigo cina ci yaje ci Yesu cina buba yanse na hacigag.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Hinda kwa aba na zangace Hwinsu zwama ina aba hyen na gya.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Halagana menwa ha yaje na Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Inga haya ikope na hanasi hab aliyi na gope na maringya Urshalima, na lokaci uni na zangi Barnaba. Na malage Titus hinda. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Hwinsu ube una cibe na halabuwa ana gya kure Urshalima kwa na ciba ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci gya na egyi aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu. Na i haruni na ciswin pa aco na asa alabe pa ba, zwama iwasa i gya na eago ibwana i kawui. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Koma Titus, ana gaci ciyiwa tare naba, aza buna bu san bware dole a egyi bware kaciya,ko inga bware busa buco Bahelene. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Cikarigo ci kaciya ci masinge zwama anhunwo a cibye a ci ista zwama a hacigage i curu na u gaci ciza pa Yesu Almasihu a ginbo aci maisi agyama. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ci yajuwa ko cimu, zwama ci ginbo cikarigo ci burya̠ ci kamahinda cima dale na ga̱hi. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Hinda aco na ginbo a hyan ga an aba sa aco labe-ko asa beya uinadamuwa gya; zwama Hwinsu ui madamuwa muhyanu mui ijapu ui jidanuwa ihya pa cikarigo aci mui. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ni haruni, aci hyan inga Hwinsu uba cipa cikarigo kurwa pa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa, nga̠ Bitrus aba sa pa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Inga Hwinsu, uba sanse na ibwana lokaci u Bitrus kurwa pa Hayahudawa, harbuni uba yanse na ibwan na lokaci numui kurwa pa aco na ai sa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakub, Bitrus na Yohana, ana aba san ga cilabe ca aco, aci ce na siwa sirya na gya na Barnaba inga aba hyan i burya̱ i Hwinsu na icwa na mui. Ayaje an gaci naba ci kore pa aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu, na Hayahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ina aba ginbage pa Bulus uta maingana na aco na za ihya, ina gya na ginbage sa bini.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus u butaga Bitrus na Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Nga̱ Bitrus aba kore Antakiya, kwa gya na butagan bware na sinu bware, zwama bware bu i ina ya sa burya̠ . <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Na jigo Bitrus a yanse na ryaga mare na aco na ai sa Hayahudawa kafi aco na a sirya pa Yakub. Ama inga aco aba a korya kwa bware cure ere mare aco na a i haruni zwama bu hoge iwas aco na hyen a egyi aco ai sa hayahudawa kaciya. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Harbuni Bitrus na Hayahudawa ha mewa hab gami wa na manafunci, cikarigo cini ci ka̱ri numui Barnaba u laganga pa manafunci mani. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Inga gya na hyan aza lagana inga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci kamahinda ciba zwamage, kwa gya na karigyana Bitrus na u'sa waba ka̱mu, &lt;&lt;Go busa Buyahudawa, ama buyiwa na ia̱go nga̱ buna bui dakuwo cikarigo ci Hwinsu sa nga̱ Buyahudawa buba ia̱gu. Bai sa, baniya, goo bu yiwa na san aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu a i dala nga̱ Hayahudawa? <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />&lt;&lt; Gaci buna cisa maco u Hayahudawa sa &lt;Aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu aco magwata̱&gt; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />ci daki an buco buza san buco bu nagu u magwata pa Hwinsu zwama yiwa na lagana icibago i Musa, kwa di sa bu tane suwa na Yesu kristi. Zwama haruni, ma, ci tano suwa na Kristi Yesu inga gaci hinda ci san aco nagu magwata zwama ilagano icibago ci Musa, zwama buna buyiwa na lagana icibago Musa, zwama, gaci ma ci yaje na Yesu kristi,buza i eaga magwat pa lagano cikarigo Musa <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Sa, ci ginbage cisa aco na za magwata̱ pa Kristi, aba kurya aci bangi gaci sicwa asici cisa aco magwat, uni ui sa an Yesu i yaje na magwata̱? Aye, Ko cimu! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Sa na jidane ima ina gya na huzagi, na cibe an gya nasa buna hacigag icibago ci Musa. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Pa icibago i Musa nasa buco bu bo kwajo zwama gya nasa bu Hwinsu. A ni hune na Kristi zata u u'on masucu <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />A na jukai na o'on masacu tare na Kristi hinda sa gyamui na yiwa doone ama Kristi ibe iyiwa na suwa numui. Dala na gya na yiwa na ikanga, Asa dala iyajo na Bwa bu Hwinsu, buna zwama maka̠la̠ man ma buba na ka̱ri bu cuta icwa ibuba zwama gya. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Na za iyagaga iyi burya̠ a Hwinsu, ama sa buco bwe san buco nagu u magwata̱ zwama ilagano icibago Musa, ikwaju i Kristi iza jidano ihya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Itano i suwa ko ilagano i cibago ci Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />ga̠hin Hagalatiyawa han ha za mahansa!ko ai egyi byaco pya? na haisa a hanhin aba jukain Yesu Kristi aba kamga yan hakosa. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Na ginbo na eagya makabo maikan: Ahuru a burya̠ a korya anhwanhi pa ilagano icibago i Musa, ko zwama iyadwo ina ganhi i hoge? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Be san ganhi iza mahansa? I rwage na anhuru a burya̠ , i ginbo na hogi na koce nihi? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />I eewo wahala usa ka̠mu- uma i haruniyo? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Hwinsu ui pan ahuru a burya̠ zwama hinda i egyi i mamake apahin zwama i lagano icibago i Musa, ko zwama gahi i yaje na ina gahi i hoge? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Byanaje Ibrahim: &lt;&lt; Bware bu yaje na Hwinsu, hal a rubi bware buco bu burya̠ .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />To na haruni ai daki, aco na yaje ai ogan ga saawo sa Ibrahim. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci zwamage na jigo an aco na ai sa Hayahudawa ai hyan ihuga zwama itano i suwa, zwama tun na jigo a zwama Ibrahim cikarigo ci laco:&lt;&lt; Kanmu mu'og ai tana mua uno u burya̠ zwama bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Zwama haruni aco na a tane shuwa ai tana ga uno u burya̠ tare Ibrahim,buco bwe iyajo. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Kanmu aco na a inga an ilagano icibago i Musa aza uno uwo, zwama a rubuci: &lt;&lt;zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hyen tiganba buna boi laganuwa ina aba rubuci na utakada u Musa a tane bwa uno uwo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Uza na ciswin aza buna boi sana bu burya̠ sa bu yiwa na lagana icibago i Musa,zwama,&lt;&lt; Buco bu burya̠ bwe yinsana zwama itano i suwa i buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Icibago i Musa isa zwama itano i suwa; sa harbuniyo, &lt;&lt; Buna bu egyi ini yiwa na icibago i Musa bui yinsana zwama ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kristi a ci cagage pa uno eewo una u sirya zwama icibago i Musa ci siro own, zwama a rubuci: &lt;&lt;Itano i unu eewo isa ka̠mu buna aba jukai na u'on.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Yesu i ci cyagage zwama uno u burya̠ u Ibrahim u korya pa aco na dakuwo Hwinsu zwama Kristi Yesu, na itano i soo aco a ce ahunru a burya̠ .<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banbanci ui cibago i Musa na alkawali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Ahun, na ia̠gi kwatanci ina ga̠hi sabe naba. nga̠ ga̠hi i daki an sa aco barya a i alkawali hinda a ma cumage aza buna bu jobe i jidana ihya, harbuni zwama uni uba yiwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Alkawali an aba ia̠gi Ibrahim na azwaga a bware. Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hinwo &lt;&lt;Na birwa,&gt;&gt; wato aco dinyiya, ama &lt;&lt;na birwa a bubui,&gt;&gt; Wato buco buika, bube busa Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ina gya na ginbo zwame bena: Icibago i Musa ina aba ia̠gi bware alkawali na haya dari nasi na kope hataco haza ihuzaga kucuna ku Hwinsu ub egyi Ibrahim <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Wasa an hyen a eagu gajo i burya̠ pa icibago i Musa, aza ihyanakana pa alkawali; ama Hwinsu na yama uba kwa na pan Ibrahim na yina alkawali. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Bai, hinda, ina san aba kole icibago i Musa? A jidane zwam aci cibe magwat maci na fili hal hon na azwaga a Ibrahim a wuco. Hinda icibago i Musa kole pa wa u acuma a Hwinsu pa aco na Hwinsu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Hinda aza iginbaga buco buna bui yisana na usa, sibuna aba yiwa na zwama buba bu yiwa bwekan; ama Hwinsu usa uikan. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ashe icibago i Musa, harbuni, i yajuwa na alkawali a Hwinsu? Aye, Ko cinmu! Sa kole icibago ina ci sana gaci ta kwado, Ia̠gu i burya̠ i korya pa icibago. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci zwamage an doone ka̠mu asa gyama i magwata̱, zwama alkawali an aba ci ia̠gi, pa tano i suwa na Yesu Kristi, a pa aco na yaje na Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kafi zwam itano soo uba korya, cikarigo ci Musa ci palage, hal lokaci una itano i shuwa iba mahin pa gaci, <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Wato ci cutan pa icibago i Musa zwama ici kole pa Kristi inga iyajo i san ci san aco nagu magwata̱ pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Baniya nga̠ itano i soo eba ya korwa, ci zawa aco na yiwa na soo pa icibago i Musa.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bwa bu Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ka̠mu nuhin isa saawo sa Hwinsu zwama itano i shuwa pa Yesu Kristi, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />zwama ka̠mu nuhin aba ia̠gi baptisma na iziya i Kristi i zango ka̠mu soo u Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Zwama haruni aza bayahude ko buna boi san bayahude, bugyama ko buna bui san bugyama, bu cware ko bu'a, zwama ka̠mu isa i binkan pa Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Si busa bu Kristi, busa azwaga a Ibrahim na bero yaba nga̠ alkawali aba zwamage.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ina gya nayiwa na zwamag mudin bwa bu yaba buna bu sa magaji buyiwa na yaba, buba na bugyam asa i binkan, ko inga uba sa ina iyiwa na yaba isa kanmu i buba. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Bu yiwa na wa u hacaca ha buba na aco na ai pan bwa shawara hal hon na u buca bu buba buba i. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Harbuni, uba sa na gaci saawo, cisa inga gyama an yiwa na cugwama ci dwoniya. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Ama inga lokaci uba i, Hwinsu u cuma na Bwa buba, maco u bu'a, maco u icibago i Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />zwama bu handgage aco na yiwa na lagan icibago i Musa, zwama ci ce ina i kamace isa i saawo. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Zwama isa saawo, Hwinsu u cuma anhurun a burya̠ oba na hashuw a haci, anhurun ana a ci oga na hyen,&lt;&lt; Abba, Buca.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Zwama haruni bwe sawa bugyama, ama sawu si cware na saawo si si'a; hinda inga go busa bwa, Hwinsu u mesiu buco bu magaji.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus u cibe damuwa uba zwama Hagaliyawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Na jigu, lokaci una ganhi i dakuwo Hwinsu, isa gyama pa aco na tun ni i'egu ai sa hwinsu. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ama bane inga ganhin i daki Hwinsu-ko nabiya Hwinsu ui daki- be san ganhi ima rege pa cugwama ci dwoniya cina ciza koce? I ginbo a jidane na isa cigyama hinda? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />gahin abuna si zangi munho na hapyana na halokaci na haya! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Na yiwa na hoge iwasa nahin zwama ina ganhin i yiwa na ia̠ga, na hyan ingana na hacigage lokaci na ganhin. <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Na gami na Hwinsu, ahun, inyaga na gya, zwama gya ma na sase nga̱ ga̱hi. I na ia̱guwo ina ya kamacuwa hya. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Nga̱ ga̱hi i daki an zwama nagu u lafiya ube usa gya na rwage na eagya cikarigo ci burya̠ . <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ko inga nagu u lafiya numui u sa idamuwa pa ganhin, kamu na haruni i na yagaguwa ko i wonje na byana. Kwa, ganhin na ca na siwa sirya inga i hyan acuma a Hwinsu, inga nasa Kristi Yesu na icwa eba. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Wanwo nuhin u kore honba?Na daki, sa wasa, ya zacaga haisa zwama gya ina pan. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Baniya na sano buco bu wo zwama gya na zwama kamahinda? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Aco ce ai komgage na zwama ai ringiya paba, ama ina aba ginbo na ganhi i gyamacuwa. Ina aba ginbo aci rebi na ganhin,inga hashuwa an hanhi hab hai maringya hwab. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />U gyamace buco bu za koce soo, sa ina buba za na shuwa isa burya̠ ,na tohonba sa lokaci una gya na yiwa na ganhin. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Sawo asimui, Baniya usa wa lagi gya na yiwa na hoge shongorwa maco nuhin kwa na hyan Kristi i ese na soo nuhin, <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />na ka̱ri baniya gya yan tare na ganhin na ma saka bicwarwa a bumui, zwama na ma dame dinyiya na gahin!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali u Hagar na Saratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Na zwamaja, ganhin buna i ginbo i yan na icibago i Musa, i dakuwo ina icibago i Musa iba hyen? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Hinda a rubuci an Ibrahim i mace saawo sirya, bwekan pa bugyama bu'a hinda bucagiya pa bu'a buna buza yanci. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Bwa bu bware bu bugyama bu'a an mace bwa harboce; ama bwa bu bu'a buna buza yanci a mace zwama alkawali. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ina isa inga misali, u si'a sina sirya sisa kucuna. Kucuna kuikan kusa ku e'og i Sinai ina i mace saawo sina sisa gyama: Bube busa Ihajara. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Baniya Ihajara habe hasa e'og i Sinai ahwaya na Arabiya ina isa e'og i labe Urushalima, zwama baniya iba na saawo seba ayiwa na cigyama. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ama Urushalima una u zaro uza yanci,hinda ube usa amaci naci. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Zwama a rubuci na cikarigo ci Hwinsu an: &lt;&lt;Sama na laco si'a sina si matangwa, sina siza imace saawo; san cu'og ci laco, go buna boi sitabuwa ihoge shongorwa u cimaco; <verse eid="GAL 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Baniya ganhin, ahun, inga Ishaku, cisa saawo sa alkawali. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Na lokaci uni bwa buna aba mace harbuce bu pan saawo sina aba mace na koce a̠huru a burya̠ .Usa harbuni baniya. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ama be cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hyen? &lt;&lt;Hona bugyama bu bu'a na bwa bu buba, zwama bwa bu bugyama buza mahabusaga gajo na bwa bu bu'a buna buza yanci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Zwama haruni, ahun, cisa saawo si bu'a buna busa bugyama, ama saawo si bu'a buna buza yanci.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Yanci na suwa Yesu Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Zwamu dala a yanci ubiya usa Yesu Kristi aba cipa yanci. yisana na kuce, hinda ita cutana sicwa asihi pa choma i cigyama. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />To na huge! Gya Bulus, nai zwama si yaje ima egyi kaciya, Yesu kristi ai jidanuwa pa ganhi. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Hinda ni zwama a egi bu kaciya bu sana dole bu laga kanmu icibago i musa kamu. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />gahin buna iyiwa na eaga kokari isa aco nagu magwata na gaba Hwinsu na lagano icibago i Musa irigyanu isa lacumu na i burya̠ asihi na lagano i Yesu Kristi; <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Zwama pa i a̠huru a burya̠ hinda na yajo isuwa nuci ciyawa na ape na tano i soo na hyanwi i adalci. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Zwama ciyuwa na suwa u Yesu Kristi ko na nagu u kaciya ihye burya̠ iza balle. Amma ina iciba icwa yoba pa maka̠la̠. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />I daki i yiwa na munda mu burya̠ , gamba bu ka̱ri na gazgana i lagano kamahinda? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kamahinda cibe cina aba yiwa na egya, ca kurya pa Hwinsu una wa i'uga. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />&lt;&lt;Inga aba ai zwama, na kuce wu yist cimu abiya sisa burodi upa umuse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Zwama zumunci nuciye na suwa ibwana bugwama bu duniya na daki iz iyaje na cicagiya cikarigowa. Hinda buna bwe asingya hankali nahi bwe so hunkuci, ko busa gamba. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ahun namu, si hal kabaniya sa na siwa na zwamag cikarigo ci kaciya, biya sa hal kabaniya aba yiwa na wunda? Si harbuniya cikarigiwo ci ikwaju i Yesu Kristi zata na u'o uza isana ujubuta pa bucahya. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Pa aco na si ansingye hankali nahin, na yiwa na eag anhunda a re gaba aba majukure asa mubwala icwa yaba. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ahun, namui, ai uga ganhi isa aco yanci. Amma i tane haisa zwama yanci nuhin utasa ganhi i hin yina ai laganu ibwana i ikanga nahiya; kwadi, gahi sa agyama a hun nahi na maka̠la̠. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Zwama kanmu icibago i Musa a tanaga ca ihuga ikan:&lt;&lt;ka̱la̱ buna bu yabta na guwa inga icwa nabuya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Amma si iyiwa na cihuriya ganhi-ganhi, gahi na mahakanga inga nama hila, i masikiyi zwama i pwa na mahunaga kamu gahi-gahi.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dala na anhuru Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ina gya na zwama biniya, i iyi cihano na anhunru a burya̠ , iza lagana maka̠la̠ ma ikanga ma eewo. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Zwama ina ikanga nuci ginbaga isa ina ahuru a Yesu ai kanruwo, hinda ina ahuru a Yesu uba ka̱ri ma iyi gaba ni ina ikanga nuci. Ini barya aza gami ihuga inka, zwama ita pwa eag ina bu gimba eag. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Si ahuru a Hwinsu abiya ayuwa na kadaga, to aza karkashi a icibago ci Musa <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ibwana i ciri ikanga buca biniya na japu: cidan, na gimbe-gimbe u si'a na gimbo dala ai hogo i laco: <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />na lagana ina i sa Hwinsu, na mahya, na mawunda, na cihuriya, na isibu, na ubobo u suwa, na maka̠la̠ ma sicwa, na ansigo i sicwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />na sibu na iso maro, na lago u swage hinda na iru iniya kamu na yiwa na zwamana inga gya na jidane na zwama na da ana egu zwamuniya aza isi cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ama saawo si ahuru a burya̠ ayiwa inga harbuna: maka̠la̠, na wa̱wo, na labutuwa suwa, na hankuri, na yibutuwa suwa, na hankuri, na kirki, na i burya̠ nahali burya̠ aminci. <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />na buna bwui karuwa suratu, hinda na buna si zaka kuce usuwa ububa kamu zwamuna cicibago ci musa ca gazaguwo nuba. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Kamu aco na ayiwa na Yesu Kristi aringyano a jukuwa suca sisiba zata na u'oh watau hali a ikanga na hali a muguta iri-iri ana ikanga iba gimbo. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Nga̱ ubasa a huru aburya̠ acipano rai, A huru aburya̠ aci lagai pai ihuga burya̠ . <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />cita sana aco si dadiya sicwa ko aco na si asingiya hankali na aco saba, ko aco na si huge cibu na aco saba.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Iyagu iburya̠ pako kama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Ahun namui, si kumbe buco na magwata, ganhi buna a̠huru burya̠ aba yiwa tare na gahi iringiya bua na hankali amma gahi ma iyi na hankali zwama gahima ita maginda. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Taimaka sicwa asihi pai zaga cuma a cidama ci Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Si bucohya buyiwa na henaga kwa ibuba na busa ihye hinda buba bua sa ihye, bu yiwa na rude icwa i buba. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Amma tagamba bu gwaji icwa i buba. hinda bwe izangacu ina buba iyi na icwa i buba, sa kwa bu gwaji eewo buba na bucagiya. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Zwamu u zaki tagamba bu zangi icwana i buba. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />hinda buna aba cibagi cikarigiwo Yesu Kristi buba bu hapsage kamu i burya̠ na buna bu cibage ba. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ita maruda sucwa sihi: ai aza buna bwe ege Hwinsu masa. kamu ina buco buba kabe ibiya buba bei gube. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Zwamu buko buna bukabe na lagano laco wikanga, wi kulabua pai gubu i uwo; buna bukabe zwamu businj in ya hun abuare aba gimbo, ikalabua bu gube a̠huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Zwamu harbuniya cita nibaga na hyega i burya̠, lokaci ayuwa na kura cigube hye burya̠ . watau Albarka. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />to zwamu harbuniya, inga gaci ciza zarafi, gaci ci iyi i burya̠ paco kamu mussamma ana sa alagano a Yesu Kristi .<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">I hogu cigarigiwo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Benaje irwa cihiro cilabe cina gya na rubuci dinya na wanumiya <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />to acona gimbago aba hyega inga sa ihye na japu a gimbo nasana dole gahi iyi kaciya. Dalilin una sa aba zwama wahawa una aba iso zwama iziya Yesu Kristi <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Ai aco ana aba egiye kaciya ma alagano cicbago ci Musa, aba di agimbo ai hyegiyi kaciya zwamu a hina na zagcaga suco siba na zwamaga abiya asa aba egiye kaciya. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Zwamu harbuniya gya naza na idada'a icwa nimuya kwa diyi zwamu ijucuwa iyesu Kristi Bugwama bu duniya. zwamu pau'oh bware zata na u'ot sha'ani a duniya aba kwaji a kumuye, gya hinda na kwajo na sha'ani a duniya. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kaciya na nagu kaciya uza wahe; inasa labe kamu buco buhiye maco upo iwo ka̠mu buza iyekana. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Dala a burya̠ na Yama yilagana ka̠mu muna bu lagano karda, watao tare na isra'ila i Hwinsu. <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Daga baniya kurwa gaba ahun namiya, nakaruwa bucahya buna dame zwama wahe, hacumi hana gye naza na kange hayuwa na cigaba ana gya nasa Bugyama bu Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Curya̠ i burya̠ a Buca̠ bu yaba abuci Yesu Kristi a yan tare na a̠huru nahi, ahun nimui Harbuni.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>